# Copy this file to `.env.local` (git-ignored) and fill it in to test the contact
# form locally. On Vercel, set the same name under Project → Settings →
# Environment Variables, then redeploy — Vite bakes the value in at build time.
#
# Get a key at https://web3forms.com : enter the email address that should
# receive messages and the key is emailed to it. It is safe to be public — it
# can only send *to* that one address.
#
# Leave it empty and the form still works, but degrades to opening the
# visitor's own mail app instead of delivering the message itself.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
